  "ingredients": [
    "6 skinless, boneless chicken breasts",
    "1.5 (1 ounce) packages dry onion soup mix",
    "1 (16 ounce) can jellied cranberry sauce",
    "1 cup French dressing"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Place chicken breasts in a 9x13-inch baking dish in a single layer.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/44B8emVRSS367sHW-PaE0ZQL6d4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8502-cranberry-chicken-VAT-step-01-be368e2696bd4d0f96438de3ecef67e3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8502/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir onion soup mix, cranberry sauce, and French dressing together in a bowl until well blended. Pour over chicken breasts. Cover the baking dish with plastic wrap, and refrigerate at least 8 hours.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/PRI8FVEkJrtiQYnYL5879J6HIHA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8502-cranberry-chicken-VAT-step-02-60b0adfcfd6142449d13dd7d4b823207.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8502/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Remove plastic wrap from the baking dish, and cover loosely with aluminum foil.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/wYXSF4U6fI2bF7TklM9yV_ixna0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8502-cranberry-chicken-VAT-step-03-4aa24dede2d44146906a99817d8fe0ee.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8502/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake chicken in preheated oven, uncovered, until until chicken is no longer pink in the center and juices run clear, about 1 hour. An instant-read thermometer should read at least 165 degrees F (74 degrees C). If the sauce thickens too much, stir in 2 tablespoons water or chicken broth halfway through baking.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/yt96rm_bXPn_oChpxMWI-Nr0wrg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8502-cranberry-chicken-VAT-step-04-2d62e5f55b8d4a5fa6a767168bb76051.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8502/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spoon sauce over chicken before serving.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/pCioUXqpa7grMfT4SaU7EDVVMfk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8502-cranberry-chicken-VAT-step-05-e15d8c37ec5f4d5293928f3bdc99264e.jpg"
